    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOT EASY, NOT SORRY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully offline, true indie, solo-developed mid-core 2.5D looter-shooter with hand-drawn visuals and fast-paced combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s hard by design\u2014you WILL get better.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based gameplay combines decision making and gradual progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenging yet fair action game where success depends on skill and strategy, not luck alone. Master mechanics, leverage upgrades, and adapt to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Unique Universe \u2013 A beautifully hand-drawn world filled with distinct creatures, enemies, and immersive environments.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Distinct Biomes \u2013 Each with unique enemies, traps, surroundings, and interactive encounters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Challenging Boss Fights \u2013 Face 9 Mini Bosses, 3 Major Bosses, and a Final Boss, each with unique mechanics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wearable Items &amp; Weapons \u2013 Customize your loadout with gear that provides unique perks and playstyles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgradeable Village \u2013 Unlock 27 permanent upgrades to enhance abilities and refine your strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 120+ Perks \u2013 A deep perk system with tree-like progression for limitless builds and replayability.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique enemies \u2014 Every one with it unique style, attacks and skills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Focus:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-Oriented Progression \u2013 No artificial difficulty\u2014your own skill and strategy determine success.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tough Yet Fair \u2013 Charming visuals, brutal challenge. You earn every victory.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Final Touches:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fully offline!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No F2P Mechanics. \u2013 A pure, premium experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot\u2019n\u2019Shell isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s a test of mastery in a visually stunning, deceptively tough world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to prove yourself?</p>",
